<p>			  11,743     11,663	11,694	11,525</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said current quarter net income of $11.4 million includes a one-time pretax gain of $3.5 million ($2.2 million after tax or $0.19 per share) on the sale of the company's former headquarters. Accordingly net income exclusive of the facility gain is $9.2 million ($0.78 per share) and represents a 16 percent increase over the same quarter last year.  Higher sales and improved gross margins were the primary factors contributing to this income growth.</p>
<p>Full company name is Coherent Inc.</p>
